# NOTE: this Version is the display/release version only - it is NOT what goes
# on the wire. We broadcast a fixed PWB.protocolVersion (see main.lua) so our
# releases never trigger "new version available" popups on other clients,
# including the "2.0.0" fork by Juliette. Bump this Version freely on release.
#
# Identity rule: never release a 2.x version - "2.0.0" is the fork. The next
# major after 1.x is 3.0.0. Nothing on the wire depends on this anymore; it's
# purely a naming choice to stay clearly distinct from the fork.

